Package: plimanshiny
Title: A shiny app for the pliman package
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Tiago", "Olivoto", , "tiagoolivoto@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an interactive Shiny-based graphical user interface
    for the 'pliman' package, enabling user-friendly access to advanced
    plant image analysis tools without requiring extensive programming
    expertise. The application integrates functionalities for
    high-throughput phenotyping, including orthomosaic analysis from drone
    and satellite imagery, shapefile creation and management, image
    processing, and phytopathometry.
